 freescout-cve-2026-40497  —  PatchClosure-Bench gold case  —  REAL Docker repro
 CVE-2025-48489 (original)  ->  CVE-2026-40497 (incomplete-fix residual)
 Product: FreeScout (PHP/Laravel help desk).  Sink: mailbox signature rendered
 unescaped in the conversation view by Conversation::getSignatureProcessed().
 Guard: Helper::stripDangerousTags() (a blocklist that grows across versions).
 run_mode=real-app-http, external_http_trigger=true, is_verbatim_lift=false.
